  "cooked": "<p>For cross-reference, my original October 5 bitcoindev post is here:\n<a href=\"https://groups.google.com/g/bitcoindev/c/yoL5VVMO4Qg\" class=\"onebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://groups.google.com/g/bitcoindev/c/yoL5VVMO4Qg</a></p>\n<p>Draft v2.1 is now published:\n</p><aside class=\"onebox githubcommit\" data-onebox-src=\"https://github.com/lukecarriere/bip-cosigner-spending-policies/commit/c21ed45c1eb78a562962d17a5fdaa86c9d7befb3\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/lukecarriere/bip-cosigner-spending-policies/commit/c21ed45c1eb78a562962d17a5fdaa86c9d7befb3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">github.com/lukecarriere/bip-cosigner-spending-policies</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"github-row\">\n  <div class=\"github-icon-container\" title=\"Commit\">\n    <svg width=\"60\" height=\"60\" class=\"github-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 14 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10.86 7c-.45-1.72-2-3-3.86-3-1.86 0-3.41 1.28-3.86 3H0v2h3.14c.45 1.72 2 3 3.86 3 1.86 0 3.41-1.28 3.86-3H14V7h-3.14zM7 10.2c-1.22 0-2.2-.98-2.2-2.2 0-1.22.98-2.2 2.2-2.2 1.22 0 2.2.98 2.2 2.2 0 1.22-.98 2.2-2.2 2.2z\"></path></svg>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"github-info-container\">\n    <h4>\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/lukecarriere/bip-cosigner-spending-policies/commit/c21ed45c1eb78a562962d17a5fdaa86c9d7befb3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">BIP draft v2.1: verifier semantics, signed finality, k-of-n threshold fix, citations and header updates (see Changelog)</a>\n    </h4>\n\n    <div class=\"github-info\">\n      <div class=\"date\">\n        committed <span class=\"discourse-local-date\" data-format=\"ll\" data-date=\"2026-11-08\" data-time=\"21:16:55\" data-timezone=\"UTC\">09:16PM - 08 Nov 26 UTC</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"user\">\n        <a href=\"https://github.com/lukecarriere\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">\n          <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://delvingbitcoin.org/uploads/default/original/2X/0/04457f3181c887910581afaea5434f4727c85a2a.png\" class=\"onebox-avatar-inline\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-dominant-color=\"645340\">\n          lukecarriere\n        </a>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"lines\" title=\"changed 1 files with 96 additions and 27 deletions\">\n        <a href=\"https://github.com/lukecarriere/bip-cosigner-spending-policies/commit/c21ed45c1eb78a562962d17a5fdaa86c9d7befb3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">\n          <span class=\"added\">+96</span>\n          <span class=\"removed\">-27</span>\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>Thanks <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/tehiyadu\">@tehiyadu</a> and <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/predge\">@PREDGE</a>. This incorporates strict verifier semantics, versioned commitments and signed finality, plus the k-of-n correction, citation fixes and header updates. The complete schema, exact-byte vectors and reference implementation remain unfinished. It is still a draft seeking criticism; comments here or on the mailing list are welcome.</p>",
